{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"2b27bfc73cf3f2a3db9559424bd27f9a4585a3f19fed72550aafd9ad2d9f68c7","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"f7641a73ef53957fb0485b33b1aa7d135467409f556f72c351b6150f004e95af","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"源文“appear human”在 target 中被译成“看起来像活着一样”，把“像人类”改成了“像活人”。依据 engine@624a673 的 game/modules/tome/data/timed_effects/other.lua:2604-2621：CLOAK_OF_DECEPTION 的 long_desc 写的是“making it look human”；activate 把阵营设为 allied-kingdoms，并在不死族身上设置 fake_race=\"Human\"、fake_subrace=\"Cornac\"。所以这个效果是伪装成人类，不是让目标看起来还活着，应译为“看起来像人类”。"},{"revision_key":"f78b208ac1339275462eccbe631bfdb774062c7b7176b047b072786b7987612e","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f7bd4de1f91451ebe16d1927f0b5ce047318d81002068752738c63bd9ff08cf8","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f7dcde0d27809868efd0e42641715902f2c9657933cfdfc32d22ad4f0a7b5871","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f8180dfe1116080a85bf70f93352e02f2f613a4f0d5d83fc1d58e13f6d509456","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"target 把“hematite moon eclipsing a golden sun”译成“红月吞日”：hematite 被译成“红”，golden 被删掉了。依据 engine@624a673 的 world-artifacts-far-east.lua:57，这件物品的 unided_name 是“a gray and gold pendant”，说明赤铁矿月亮是灰色、太阳是金色。“红月”与这一灰金配色矛盾，应改为“赤铁矿（灰色）之月遮蔽金色太阳”这一类表述。"},{"revision_key":"f82b87605f65a02291c279b768b9722fa89d0461a67a573a5054e6a62e3bff3c","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"f83a8191e966db8ebd1c7b88f3c053c38d1c05394b20452aef239ec110f28195","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"源文主语“Corrupted vapour rises at the target location”（堕落蒸汽在目标位置升起）在 target 中被译成“蒸腾目标区域”：主语“堕落蒸汽”丢失，“蒸腾”被当成及物动词，意思变成“使目标区域蒸腾”，句子不通，也没说明造成伤害的是蒸汽（参见 npcs.lua:1386）。"},{"revision_key":"f894de79df6d2ecec361043978ae052e31f288ef0034c595ee979ae68db2af8d","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"target 删掉了三处机制限定。一是分裂出的软泥怪出现在“nearby within your line of sight”（附近且在视线内）。二是数量上限“(limited by talent level and the summoning limit)”：依据 ooze.lua:36，getMax 同时受 checkMaxSummon 的召唤上限和技能等级限制。三是伤害均摊只在“so long as this talent is active”期间成立。删掉后，上限和均摊都读成无条件的，与 ooze.lua:112-119 不一致。"}]}